  "description": "Visma.Net Connector for DynamicWeb 10 and 9\n\nIntegrate Visma.Net ERP seamlessly with DynamicWeb and automate your entire business flow between webshop and ERP. The connector transfers key datasets from Visma.Net to DynamicWeb, including product data, BOMs, customers, customer-specific prices and discounts, payment methods, payment terms, currencies, user accounts, user groups, addresses, shipping methods, brands and stock across single or multiple warehouses.\n\nThe connector includes preconfigured integration flows that work out of the box, while also allowing full customization to fit your specific needs. You can control which fields to import, how frequently data is updated, and how orders are sent back to Visma.Net.\n\nData flows bidirectionally where relevant: orders, deliveries and BOM updates are sent from DynamicWeb back into Visma.Net to ensure accurate fulfilment and financial processing. In addition, the DynamicWeb Customer Center receives invoices, credit notes and customer account data directly from Visma.Net, giving customers full visibility into their order and financial history.\n\nDeveloped for DynamicWeb 10.x and DynamicWeb 9.1x.x - contact Flex Media for details. Requires Visma.Net API access and an active Flex Media license.\n\nIncludes comprehensive documentation and setup guide.\n\nRead more and get started: https://www.flex-media.dk/erp-integration/dynamicweb-visma-net-integration \n\nSupport: support@flexmedia.dk | +45 4817 6666 / +45 4422 8430",
