  "releaseNotes": "A new scheduled task has been introduced to update Dynamicweb order states based on the corresponding order status in Visma.Net. \n\t\t\tThe task retrieves the current order status from Visma.Net and synchronizes the order state in Dynamicweb accordingly(mapping required).\n\t\t\tPrice control setting has been added. \n\t\t\tThis setting determines whether Dynamicweb or Visma.Net acts as the master system for product pricing during order exporting.",
